# Starglider 2 (Rainbird/Argonaut, 1988) - PSGFX hook profile for STBOX.
# Written by psgfx-scan (projection idiom + read watch, see psgfx-scan-design.md
# sections 5 and 5d). Arms only when every expect= matches the code in box RAM.
#lift sg2
